; ===========================================================================
; Accounts
; ===========================================================================
; Only accounts with actual postings are declared here.
; All other accounts (Assets:Bank:*, Assets:Investment:*:<TICKER>,
; Equity:Transfers:*, etc.) are auto-created by beancount.plugins.auto_accounts
; on first use. See main.bean.

; Assets
1900-01-01 open Assets:Investment:XP:Cash BRL

; Expenses
1900-01-01 open Expenses:Investment:BB:Fees BRL
1900-01-01 open Expenses:Investment:Inter:Fees BRL

; Income
1900-01-01 open Income:Investment:BB:Gains BRL
1900-01-01 open Income:Investment:Inter:Interest BRL

; Equity
; Pre-tracking net worth; pad source for opening balances (see opening_balances.bean)
1900-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances BRL

; Liabilities
1900-01-01 open Liabilities:Credit:BB:Card:EloGrafite BRL
; PlatinumVisa is multicurrency (BRL, USD, ARS, SGD) — no currency constraint.
1900-01-01 open Liabilities:Credit:BB:Card:PlatinumVisa

